[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238177\">4410A10</a></p><p>1. Fit the flanges (1a) on the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Flanges</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.662.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.089.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018219.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Fit the shock absorber-spring assembly on the support tool and\ncompress it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018220.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut (1a) for the upper shock absorber buffer using \ntools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.663.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.664.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018221.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Loosen the compression tool and remove spring (1a), shock absorber\n(1b), upper plate (1c), and upper buffer (1d).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018222.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Assemble the components of the shock absorber-spring assembly\nusing the tool for centring the shock absorber strut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Flanges</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.662.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018223.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) for the shock absorber upper buffer to the\nrecommended torque using tools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT DAMPER TOP ATTACHMENT</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.1 - 3.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.663.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.664.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018224.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Loosen the support tool and\nremove the shock absorber-spring assembly.</p><p>Reposition the tool used for dismantling-reassembling the\nshock absorber-spring assembly.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238177\">4410A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a></p><p>Check and if necessary check the wheel\ngeometry values \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238217\">4450A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]